rrup.size}@${c.stirrup.pitchMm}`,\r\n 995:           entry.mark as string,\r\n 996:         ).toBe(normPitch(entry.スターラップ as string))\r\n 997:       }\r\n 998:     }\r\n 999:   })\r\n1000: \r\n1001:   it('karatsu 地中梁リスト — 세로형·별표 치수·다중 부호를 전 셀 대조한다', () => {\r\n1002:     const doc = readExpected<{\r\n1003:       entries: Array<Record<string, unknown>>\r\n1004:     }>('karatsu-karayaku-s4-foundation-girders.json')\r\n1005:     const parsed = parseSectionLists(readPage('karatsu-shousai-p1.json'))\r\n1006:     const girders = list(parsed, '地中梁リスト')\r\n1007: \r\n1008:     for (const entry of doc.entries) {\r\n1009:       const mark = entry.mark as string\r\n1010:       const c = candidate(girders, mark)\r\n1011:       expect(c.kind, mark).toBe('対象外')\r\n1012:       expect({ b: c.b, depth: c.depth }, mark).toEqual({\r\n1013:         b: entry.b,\r\n1014:         depth: entry.depth,\r\n1015:       })\r\n1016:       expect(c.girderMain && `${c.girderMain.topCount}-${c.girderMain.size}`, mark).toBe(\r\n1017:         entry.上筋,\r\n1018:       )\r\n1019:       expect(c.girderMain && `${c.girderMain.bottomCount}-${c.girderMain.size}`, mark).toBe(\r\n1020:         entry.下筋,\r\n1021:       )\r\n1022:       expect(c.stirrup && `${c.stirrup.size}@${c.stirrup.pitchMm}`, mark).toBe(\r\n1023:         normPitch(entry['STP.'] as string),\r\n1024:       )\r\n1025:       if (entry.腹筋) {\r\n1026:         expect(c.sideBar, mark).toEqual({ size: 'D13', count: 2 })\r\n1027:       } else {\r\n1028:         expect(c.sideBar, mark).toBeUndefined()\r\n1029:       }\r\n1030:       if (entry.備考) expect(c.raw['備考'], mark).toBe(entry.備考)\r\n1031:       expect(c.raw['符号']?.normalize('NFKC').replace(/\\s/g, ''), mark).toBe(\r\n1032:         (entry.headerCell as string).normalize('NFKC').replace(/\\s/g, ''),\r\n1033:       )\r\n1034:       expect(c.issues, mark).toEqual([])\r\n1035:     }\r\n1036:   })\r\n1037: \r\n1038:   it('textual フープ shape를 raw로 보존하면서 피치만 정규화한다', () => {\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"